<%# Patterns of rendered files under config/ that should not ship to the
   target. Anchored at config/ root (matches rsync --exclude semantics).
   Both `make sync` (--exclude-from) and the .manifest enumeration read
   this file, so excluded files are entirely unmanaged: not shipped, not
   tracked, and not subject to manifest-diff deletion on the host.

   Uses explicit (field :sync_exclude svc) rather than loop-services / a
   bare `sync_exclude` symbol so the template renders cleanly even when
   no service declares the field (e.g. in the fx-* test fixture set). -%>
# Auto-generated from per-service `sync_exclude:` lists. Do not edit.
<% (dolist (svc services)
     (dolist (pat (field :sync_exclude svc)) -%>
<%= (field :name svc) %>/<%= pat %>
<%   )) -%>
